OL,3,GNEWSAUnderground house in fishing
OL,4,Avillage loses planning appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn appeal against a council's refusal
OL,7,Fof plans for an underground house in a
OL,8,Fsouth of Scotland fishing village has
OL,9,Fbeen rejected.
OL,11,FDumfries and Galloway Council (DGC)
OL,12,Fturned down the proposals in the Isle
OL,13,Fof Whithorn on the grounds that they
OL,14,Fwould "not relate well to the character
OL,15,Fof the existing village".
OL,17,FThat decision was taken on appeal to
OL,18,Fthe Scottish government with a
OL,19,Fsupporting statement arguing it had
OL,20,Fbeen designed to have the "least impact
OL,21,Fpossible".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
