OL,3,GNEWSAUnderground house in fishing
OL,4,Avillage loses planning appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, a reporter concluded the
OL,7,F"significant harm" to the character of
OL,8,Fthe area outweighed any benefits in
OL,9,Fterms of tackling a regionwide housing
OL,10,Femergency and reducing carbon
OL,11,Femissions.
